Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.49,0:00:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill Pencarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Target Pencarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.87,0:00:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hukum Alam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Reaksi skill Raja Iblis terbaca.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia benar-benar masih hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ada Raja Iblis, semuanya akan lancar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini tidak akan gagal lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kubangun rumah kami
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.97,0:00:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bersama Tuan Raja Iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}So What's Wrong\Nwith Getting Reborn as a Goblin?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.11,0:02:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jadi malu dilihat banyak orang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tahan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka takut karena kau itu monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.06,0:02:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau dikawal agar tidak diserang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada Goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.16,0:02:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Manis sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, sepertinya mereka tidak terlalu takut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin karena kau itu Goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dulu memelihara Goblin sempat menjadi tren.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau hanya sendirian, ia penakut dan jinak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.38,0:02:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apalagi wujudnya rata-rata manis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.76,0:02:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagiku yang bereinkarnasi,\Nmereka memang manis seperti maskot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.62,0:02:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, trennya cepat berlalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.31,0:03:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena umur mereka hanya tujuh hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.01,0:03:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rumahnya besar sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kediaman milik Wedana Ophiucus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ma-Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.91,0:03:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh aku ke toilet sebentar?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.23,0:03:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong antarkan dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik, silakan ikuti saya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Letaknya jauh di pojok.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Toiletnya juga luas sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saking luasnya, aku sampai tersesat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sedang bekerja?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.05,0:03:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin, ya? Tumben.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhir-akhir ini kalian jarang terlihat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau diculik?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan, aku ke sini atas kemauan sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, mau menyerang kota?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan, aku ingin bicara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tahu soal Goblin yang membunuh manusia\Nbaru-baru ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya aku pernah dengar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku datang untuk bertanggung jawab.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau pelakunya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.74,0:04:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.07,0:04:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, akulah kepala desanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebagai perwakilan, aku ingin meminta maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tidak, desamu akan dihancurkan, begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu salah satunya,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi bukan hanya itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Manusia dan Goblin sama-sama\Nbisa berbuat kesalahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maka dari itu, mereka perlu belajar agar\Ntidak mengulangi kesalahan yang sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:52.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan sampai satu kesalahan\Nmerusak hubungan mereka ke depannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena itu, aku minta maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:05:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, kenapa kau bisa ada di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.90,0:05:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rumah ini luasnya bukan main,\Naku sampai tersesat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Toiletnya berada di pojok\Ndan luasnya tidak masuk akal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setuju!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.61,0:05:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang yang membuat toilet itu memang bodoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, jangan keras-keras,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.71,0:05:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}nanti majikanmu marah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anda di situ rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Maaf, aku tersesat.\N- Bukan kau.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bicara kepada Tuan Wedana.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Wedana? Mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beliau di belakangmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Bukankah Kakek ini\Nhanya tukang kebun di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.97,0:05:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jaga bicaramu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beliau itu Tuan Wedana Ophiucus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Paman Yang Mulia Kaisar,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sekaligus pemilik kediaman ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kakek menipuku, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak menipu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku memang hobi mengurus kebun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, berkatmu,\Naku mendengar masukan yang menarik.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anggap saja urusan kita beres.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sesi obrolan kakunya kita sudahi dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.47,0:06:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ikut aku, Goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karen, kau boleh pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dimengerti.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita mau ke mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke taman bunga.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.89,0:06:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tempat minum-minum, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, Goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau manis sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kita ke sini, Wedana Ophiucus?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita sudah akrab, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.74,0:06:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Panggil saja Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.75,0:06:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, Simon, kenapa kita ke sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena aku suka Goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jawabannya asal-asalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suka kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena seksi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pria itu harus mesum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tidak, untuk apa dia hidup?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.85,0:06:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hebat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya ampun, ingat umur, Tuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Nanti badanmu bisa sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.83,0:07:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omongannya makin asal-asalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia ini benar-benar petinggi di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini ilmu penting kalau mau menjadi penguasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.91,0:07:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk menjadi pemimpin,\Nkau harus bisa menilai sifat manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk menilai sifat wanita,\Nminimal tiduri mereka seribu kali!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau belum bisa,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}artinya dia pria yang kurang pengalaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.95,0:07:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, bagaimana cara menilai sifat pria?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ajak mereka berjudi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Judi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.76,0:07:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai dari taruhan kecil-kecilan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.32,0:07:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misalnya main kartu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sifat asli pria akan terlihat saat berjudi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu juga harus dilakukan seribu kali?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak perlu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pria lebih sederhana daripada wanita.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.55,0:07:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Main sekali saja cukup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.08,0:07:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sifat asli terlihat saat berjudi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:08:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah dia bermain aman\Natau rakus mengincar untung besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kau,\Nbagaimana caramu menilai sifat orang?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.51,0:08:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat dari kegagalannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.39,0:08:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang pasti pernah gagal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu wajar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang kunilai,\Napa mereka mengulangi kesalahan yang sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada yang bisa, ada yang tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menilainya dari situ.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudut pandang yang menarik.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masuk akal juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Obrolannya mulai membosankan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lebih baik kita fokus\Nke bunga-bunga cantik ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nikmati malam ini sepuasnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.70,0:08:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, umur ras kalian pendek, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal itu bukan masalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.45,0:08:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan skill "Umur Manusia 80 Tahun",
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa hidup sampai 80 tahun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, umurku berbeda sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku salah bicara?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sobatku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin berumur panjang\Nbisa meniduri 30 ribu wanita!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sobatku, kutitipkan impianku padamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak usah menitipkan mimpi mesum begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih sudah mampir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Datang lagi, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Walau sudah tua,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.14,0:09:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anda masih kuat sampai pagi, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sendiri sampai heran.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.67,0:09:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata Goblin tetap bugar\Nmeski bergadang semalaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong hentikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kudanya mengamuk?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.55,0:10:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Goblin, terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.19,0:10:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, tidak masalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak semua orang\Nmau menyelamatkan anak orang lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.73,0:10:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan menjamin keamanan desamu, Sobat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, kalian ingin mengadili sendiri, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berjanji akan memperlakukan desamu\Nsecara setara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Simon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, demi menjaga citra publik,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku menugaskan Karen\Nsebagai pengawas desa kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak keberatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Justru aku senang Karen\Nyang jadi pengawasnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, aku kabari warga desaku dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pamit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.43,0:10:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Kaukah itu?\N- Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai hari ini, pantau terus dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin berumur panjang
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bisa menjadi ancaman yang lebih besar\Ndaripada Raja Iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu ceritanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah bicara dengan manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang desa kita tidak akan diserang lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Kades memang hebat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.02,0:11:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keren!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ganteng, peluk aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.54,0:11:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, kita buat anak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena itu,\Naku sudah membuat aturan-aturan baru.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.09,0:11:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama, dilarang membunuh manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aturan ini sebenarnya sudah ada, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pantau terus Goblin itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak masalah kau dicurigai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika ada yang mencurigakan, segera laporkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.59,0:11:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika aku terang-terangan dijadikan pengawas,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}artinya ada pengawas lain\Nyang perlu ditutupi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang punya skill menyerang, angkat tangan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:11:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Aku!\N- Aku juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku, aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian sedang apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.13,0:12:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya, tenang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.73,0:12:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia ini rekan kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Disebut rekan oleh Goblin rasanya agak aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ini pengawas kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama kalian tak melukai manusia,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kalian akan aman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Seram.\N- Takut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan ditakut-takuti.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, namaku Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengawas kepala desa kalian\Nsekaligus perantara dengan manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Intinya, aku di pihak kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Dia baik.\N- Karen wangi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mohon bantuannya, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tadinya mau kujelaskan nanti,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi aku ingin membentuk pasukan penjaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.50,0:12:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasukan untuk menangani keributan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalaupun dibentuk,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}usia mereka hanya tujuh hari, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.05,0:13:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah itu sia-sia?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.68,0:13:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah menemukan solusinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku memilihmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai hari ini, namamu Hanzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau bicara soal nama turun-temurun,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.77,0:13:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jelas akan teringat Hattori Hanzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.27,0:13:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siap, mulai hari ini namaku Hanzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, saat Hanzo nanti tutup usia,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.64,0:13:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}nama dan skill-nya akan diwariskan\Nkepada penerusnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.61,0:13:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}anaknya akan menjadi Hanzo generasi kedua.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kemudian, kalau ada\Nyang punya skill menyerang,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia akan masuk tim Hanzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian paham?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.89,0:13:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya, siapa yang punya skill\Nmenilai barang dan menghitung uang?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku punya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai hari ini, namamu Kinokuniya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini agar mudah berbaur dengan manusia, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Manusia yang punya urusan bisnis\Nbisa menemui Kinokuniya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.69,0:13:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meskipun Goblin sebelumnya tutup usia,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:13:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}penerusnya akan mewarisi nama dan skill-nya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.32,0:14:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sistem ini bagus untuk menyiasati\Numur pendek mereka, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, berikutnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wajar Tuan Simon waspada.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia bukan Goblin sembarangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanzo, ada apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia ini penyusup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tiba-tiba menyerang,\Ntapi untung langsung kutangkap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.05,0:14:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerja bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.10,0:14:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya, aku sudah berjanji\Nkepada pasanganku,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.69,0:14:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kalau pekerjaanku selesai,\Nkami mau membuat anak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.73,0:14:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu namanya bendera kematian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya sudah, biar aku yang urus dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.57,0:14:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan biarkan wanita menunggu janjimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sana, buat anak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Kades, terima kasih banyak!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.29,0:14:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang, urus dia...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di sini rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:14:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.25,0:14:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sistem warisan itu menarik.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.97,0:15:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, meski baru generasi ketiga,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}hasil yang kumau sudah kelihatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.30,0:15:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba lihat dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia terkena luka bakar dan sayatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, memar itu karena serpihan batu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya dia punya banyak skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.78,0:15:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mulai dari pelemahan, api, sampai tanah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah punya banyak skill itu hal biasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, tapi pewarisan skill sebelumnya acak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Acak?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat manusia mempelajari skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}biasanya mereka memilih yang cocok\Ndengan kemampuan dasar mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu tak berlaku pada Goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misalnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}anak yang punya skill berhitung,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pasti mubazir kalau dapat skill penguat otot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, alasan di balik pewarisan itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.31,0:15:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin yang punya skill serangan\Nakan masuk lingkaran Hanzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:16:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan pewarisan skill itu akan berputar\Ndi lingkaran mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seandainya kemampuanku bisa\Nkuwariskan kepada Takahashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.32,0:16:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah harapan ini bisa terwujud atau tidak,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi berhubung pewarisan bisa diatur,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sayang rasanya kalau hasilnya tetap acak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk mengubah itu,\Nkuciptakan sistem pewarisan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan Goblin yang usianya\Ntujuh hari pun bisa berkembang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.79,0:16:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kami bisa saja menganggap Goblin\Nsebagai ancaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenang saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ada aku,\Nmereka tak akan memusuhi manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, kau harus panjang umur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana, ya? Batasku hanya 80 tahun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, ada perlu apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal aturan Goblin buatanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kucatat dan kulaporkan\Nkepada Tuan Wedana.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih ada yang mau kurevisi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:16:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:17:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, untuk apa membuat hukum sendiri?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.61,0:17:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya kami tidak butuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, karena kami\Nminta hak mengadili sendiri,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.75,0:17:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kami harus menunjukkan kepada manusia\Nbahwa kami punya hukum sendiri, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.24,0:17:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa di dalamnya\Ntermasuk aturan pembelaan diri?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin belum punya\Nhukum perlindungan itu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waktu itu,\Nkau juga tak mengajukan pembelaan diri, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat dia membunuh manusia itu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini alasanku tak memakai\Nargumen pembelaan diri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.03,0:17:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Negosiasi terjadi saat kedua pihak\Npunya argumen, tujuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.06,0:17:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan batas kompromi masing-masing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, keduanya mencari titik temu\Nuntuk disepakati.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.65,0:17:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Intinya, harus bisa memberi alasan masuk akal\Nkepada pihak lawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika sejak awal\Naku berargumen pembelaan diri,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}memangnya kau mau terima?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangankan kuterima,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mendengarnya saja mungkin aku tak mau.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.99,0:17:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena itu,\Naku minta hukumannya kurungan tujuh hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Buktinya, setelah kau paham itu\Nsetara dengan penjara seumur hidup,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kau langsung mau mendengarkan, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pihak yang lemah memang harus\Nberkorban lebih dalam negosiasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.07,0:18:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak kusangka dia berpikir sejauh itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari sistem warisan saja,\Njelas dia bukan Goblin sembarangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau ini kulaporkan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sudah jelas dia akan dianggap ancaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seharusnya dia sadar, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.08,0:18:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Kades!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau panik?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.09,0:18:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desa kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.81,0:18:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill Penggandaan Diri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin sialan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.06,0:18:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurang ajar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini peringatan terakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jawab pertanyaanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.82,0:18:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa kau?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kepala desa di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.91,0:19:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.65,0:19:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, jawab pertanyaanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di mana Tuan Raja Iblis?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.91,0:19:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Raja Iblis?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.05,0:19:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan dia satu ras dengan Raja Iblis?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Raja Iblis sudah mati!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.51,0:19:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang di dunia tahu soal itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu bohong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.17,0:19:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Raja Iblis tidak mungkin mati!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.73,0:19:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku percaya itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Buktinya ada...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa skill Tuan Raja Iblis ada padamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.26,0:19:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti kau yang membunuh Tuan Raja Iblis
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.41,0:19:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan mencuri kekuatannya, 'kan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.89,0:19:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengarkan dulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berisik!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.05,0:19:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kubunuh kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa boleh buat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.91,0:20:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Percuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Badannya kecil, tapi kekuatannya besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.35,0:20:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau hanya mengandalkan kekuatan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.81,0:20:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, Pantulan Serangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.07,0:20:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lepaskan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau mau kulepaskan,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dengarkan aku dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau alasan apa lagi kau?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sudah membunuh Tuan Raja Iblis\Ndan mencuri skill-nya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.78,0:20:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya Raja Iblis
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}orang bodoh yang mudah dikalahkan\Noleh Goblin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja tidak!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Raja Iblis itu hebat,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia kuat dan baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pokoknya dia yang terbaik.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.05,0:20:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Artinya, mustahil aku bisa\Nmencuri skill-nya, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu pasti karena kau memakai trik licik.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.27,0:20:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kutanya sekali lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.65,0:20:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa Raja Iblis semudah itu ditipu trik licik
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sampai skill-nya saja\Ndicuri ras lemah sepertiku?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memberi alasan masuk akal, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, kenapa skill Tuan Raja Iblis\Nada padamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.65,0:21:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seharusnya dia sudah mau mendengarku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.48,0:21:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia mewariskannya padaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diwariskan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.05,0:21:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wahai Goblin tanpa nama,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kuwariskan ini padamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suara itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tahu skill khusus Goblin, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.06,0:21:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pernah dengar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin bisa menunjukkan pesan terakhir\Nsaat mewarisi skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu benar-benar suara Tuan Raja Iblis?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.07,0:21:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sendiri\Nyang paling mengenal suaranya, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.80,0:23:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin berumur panjang
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.85,0:23:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}punya skill Raja Iblis?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.06,0:23:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa Dewa ingin menghancurkan umat manusia?
